### Phase 5 — Frontend Integration (Next.js)

#### [NEW] `frontend/src/lib/recommendations.ts`

TypeScript module with:
- `getSessionId()` — localStorage-based anonymous session tracking
- `getRecommendations(bikeId?, listingId?)` — fetches from Django API via Next.js API route proxy
- `trackBehavior(type, bikeId?, listingId?, metadata?)` — fire-and-forget POST
- TypeScript interfaces: `Recommendation`, `RecommendationResponse`

#### [NEW] `frontend/src/app/api/recommendations/route.ts`

Next.js API route that proxies to Django backend (follows existing proxy pattern in `src/proxy.ts`). Needed to avoid CORS and attach auth headers.

#### [NEW] `frontend/src/app/api/behavior/track/route.ts`

Next.js API route proxy for behavior tracking.

#### [NEW] `frontend/src/components/RecommendationSection.tsx`

React component implementing the 4-slot grid UI:
- Skeleton loader while fetching
- `RecommendationCard` sub-component per slot
- Slot badges: 🎯 Recommended · 💰 Best Value · 🏍️ Similar · ✨ Explore
- New/Used badge (green for used, blue for new)
- "Trusted Brand" (trust ≥ 80) and "Fair Price" (score ≥ 80) micro-badges
- Price displayed in **লক্ষ** (Bangladeshi lakh format)

#### [MODIFY] New Bike Detail Page — `frontend/src/app/bike/[slug]/page.tsx`

Add `<RecommendationSection bikeId={bike.id} />` below the spec sheet section. Also wire `trackBehavior('view', bike.id)` on mount.

#### [MODIFY] Used Bike Detail Page — `frontend/src/app/used-bikes/[slug]/page.tsx` or `used-bike/[slug]/page.tsx`

Add `<RecommendationSection listingId={listing.id} />`. Wire `trackBehavior('listing_view', undefined, listing.id)` on mount.

